OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Lumang-luma na ho ang building ng OWWA.

3618
03:35:24,860 --> 03:35:31,160
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, meron na po kami mga built-in waterfalls dahil sa bagyo.

3619
03:35:31,160 --> 03:35:35,900
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Actually po, to be serious about it,

3620
