3621
03:35:43,660 --> 03:35:46,300
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: The assessment po came back.

3622
03:35:46,300 --> 03:35:50,100
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And we will present to the committee.

3623
03:35:50,100 --> 03:35:54,060
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, apparently, we are only at

3624
03:35:54,060 --> 03:36:02,580
