3625
03:36:03,670 --> 03:36:07,800
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, it's more of the safety na po ng ating mga frontliners,

3626
03:36:07,840 --> 03:36:10,660
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: especially po yung ating mga OFW clients.

3627
03:36:10,860 --> 03:36:14,920
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, we are seeking as well support, Madam Chair.

3628
03:36:14,980 --> 03:36:17,100
