3693
03:42:25,180 --> 03:42:26,360
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Magandang hapon po.

3694
03:42:28,940 --> 03:42:29,540
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: All right.

3695
03:42:29,540 --> 03:42:34,820
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Next to interpellate from the majority, we have Representative Florabel Yatco.

3696
03:42:36,680 --> 03:42:39,900
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Good afternoon, Secretary, Admin PY.

3697
03:42:40,980 --> 03:42:46,080
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Itatanong ko lang naman yung tulad nung nabanggit kanina ni Congressman Tina.

3698
03:42:46,240 --> 03:42:47,380
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: It's about the OFW.

3699
03:42:47,800 --> 03:42:57,320
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Like during 25-26, ilang pamilya at OFW ang nasilbihan natin dito sa hospital na ito?

3700
03:42:57,320 --> 03:42:58,480
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: At for...

3701
03:42:58,480 --> 03:43:11,440
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: 2027 na budget natin, ano po ang mga kongkretong improvements na maaaring nilang asahan sa pagdating sa mga access services at sa quality care ng OFW?

3702
03:43:14,960 --> 03:43:21,540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: I will request Usec. Niki Tutay who handles the hospital to answer the details.

3703
03:43:21,540 --> 03:43:28,760
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But at the outset, 184,870 po ang napagsilbihan.

3704
03:43:28,900 --> 03:43:30,040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But this is beginning...

3705
03:43:30,040 --> 03:43:37,000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yung term ng ating mahal na Pangulo, ang panahon po natin sa Department of Migrant Workers.

3706
03:43:37,900 --> 03:43:42,820
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: We can provide the necessary breakdowns on a year-to-year basis.

3707
03:43:42,820 --> 03:43:52,120
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And yung kaukulang budget po na binigay sa atin is 423.59 million.

3708
03:43:52,420 --> 03:43:58,460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: However, as mentioned during the question of Congressman Rodriguez,

3709
03:43:58,940 --> 03:44:00,800
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: we are seeking an additional...

3710
03:44:00,800 --> 03:44:01,960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: 200.

3711
03:44:01,960 --> 03:44:03,680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: million.

3712
03:44:04,140 --> 03:44:08,860
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Can I request Usec. Niki, Madam Chair, to provide some more details?

3713
03:44:12,860 --> 03:44:18,940
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 'Yun pong nabanggit po ng ating kalihim ay 'yung number of patients, unique patients po ito.

3714
03:44:18,940 --> 03:44:26,040
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So it could be the OFW herself, either a family also, or pwede rin po yung parents po ng OFWs.

3715
03:44:26,160 --> 03:44:32,460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So over the years po, tumataas naman po yung ating unique patient, sir.

3716
03:44:32,640 --> 03:44:40,100
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So we started with around 7,383 back in second half of 2022.

3717
03:44:40,100 --> 03:44:46,420
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then it rose to 34,634 patients.

3718
03:44:46,980 --> 03:44:47,960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then for...

3719
03:44:47,960 --> 03:44:51,740
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 2024, it's 44,516.

3720
03:44:52,020 --> 03:44:57,380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And in 2025, 59,000 or close to 60,000 po.

3721
03:44:57,620 --> 03:45:14,040
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: For 2026 po, January until July, it's close to 40,000 na po na patients. And the services po, the diagnostics and the other medical services ay pataas po.

3722
03:45:14,280 --> 03:45:30,180
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Sa ngayon po, this year, we were able to introduce the pre-employment medical exam at a lower rate compared to the other clinics or hospitals for our overseas Filipino workers before they depart.

3723
03:45:30,180 --> 03:45:39,620
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: The other services po that we have ay yung pong cancer care, we are preparing it na.

3724
03:45:40,040 --> 03:45:44,720
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: It's currently being constructed and we do hope po that by the first...

3725
03:45:44,720 --> 03:45:46,500
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: To be launched on 2027, right?

3726
03:45:46,520 --> 03:45:47,640
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 2027 po.

3727
03:45:47,780 --> 03:45:56,800
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then we want, we're targeting a level 3 because the bed capacity is around 102.

3728
03:45:56,800 --> 03:46:03,980
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Sa ngayon po, we are at a level 2 with around 78 beds approved by the Department of Health.

3729
03:46:05,260 --> 03:46:11,700
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: But for the number of patients, do you think, is it all coming from the central Luzon?

3730
03:46:12,060 --> 03:46:12,460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: No.

3731
03:46:13,285 --> 03:46:23,360
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Based on our statistics, Your Honor, we have around 90 to 95% coming from Luzon, particularly po from central Luzon.

3732
03:46:23,360 --> 03:46:31,700
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: But we have patients coming from Mindanao, Visayas, and also as far as Bicol region po.

3733
03:46:32,440 --> 03:46:39,500
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Actually, sana nga magkaroon tayo, Mr. Chair, ng Luzon, Visayas, Mindanao na OFW Hospital.

3734
03:46:39,980 --> 03:46:42,040
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: But for my second question,

3735
03:46:42,440 --> 03:46:46,900
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: since nabanggit niyo na nga po yung cancer care center,

3736
03:46:48,160 --> 03:46:54,500
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: can the department tell us how much is the 2027 budget specifically intended for the cancer care?

3737
03:46:54,500 --> 03:46:58,360
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Aside from the 200 million, kasama na ba yung 200 million doon?

3738
03:46:58,860 --> 03:47:05,740
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Enough ba siya to serve all the cancer patients, to pay the salaries of the special doctors?

3739
03:47:05,740 --> 03:47:09,520
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: It may not be enough, Your Honor, but for

3740
03:47:09,520 --> 03:47:20,960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 2027 NEP, our budget is around 400 million po.

3741
03:47:21,080 --> 03:47:25,620
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So kaya nagpapadagdag po sana kami ng 200 million pa.

3742
03:47:26,880 --> 03:47:28,900
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then, meron po kaming...

3743
03:47:28,980 --> 03:47:42,000
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: We're thinking of a dialysis services also because most of the patients sa OFW Hospital po ay meron pong chronic disease,

3744
03:47:42,200 --> 03:47:47,960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Kidney disease, that's the top health or medical needs.

3745
03:47:47,960 --> 03:47:57,240
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then, yung cancer po ay tumataas din po yung cases po ng cancer na pumupunta po sa aming hospital.

3746
03:47:57,660 --> 03:48:02,500
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Sana ma-request niyo na yung dialysis center din, maisabay next year?

3747
03:48:02,860 --> 03:48:10,100
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Kasi, Mr. Chair, I've been in OFW and nag-medical mission na rin kami sa OFW.

3748
03:48:10,100 --> 03:48:12,520
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: And it's a very beautiful hospital.

3749
03:48:13,700 --> 03:48:16,880
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Medyo may mga kulang, kaya dapat mataasan natin yung budget.

3750
03:48:18,540 --> 03:48:22,440
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Pero maayos, na-maintain, na papatakbo ng maayos.

3751
03:48:23,780 --> 03:48:25,780
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And we're thankful, Madam Chair.

3752
03:48:26,680 --> 03:48:29,380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: She helped us po in one of the medical missions.

3753
03:48:29,380 --> 03:48:36,060
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And we would like to pursue that on a regular basis together with the Makati Medical Center.

3754
03:48:36,080 --> 03:48:39,020
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: We work with Makati Med for that for every year.

3755
03:48:39,340 --> 03:48:41,260
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: So, sana hindi lang OFW, but yung mga...

3756
03:48:41,260 --> 03:48:49,600
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: but yung mga kalapit probinsya ng malapit sa OFW, napagsilbihan natin 'yon.

