3771
03:49:34,340 --> 03:49:35,700
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Especially the cancer.

3772
03:49:35,760 --> 03:49:37,840
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Very excited kami sa cancer center.

3773
